WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:08.588
This video shows how to use the academic calendar on your phone. You will move to a month, add an off day, and save it.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:16.178
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Management, and then tap Academic Calendar.

00:00:19.982 --> 00:00:30.062
Tap the month list and choose December 2025. Then tap Month to see the days as a grid. Sundays are marked off automatically.

00:00:34.506 --> 00:00:41.322
Tap Add Event or Off Day. A form opens with three parts: What, When and Who.

00:00:42.181 --> 00:00:57.781
Type a title, here Winter Break, and change the type to OFF Day. Choose the category Winter Vacation, then set the start date and the end date to the same day. By default it applies to the whole school, students and staff.

00:01:06.393 --> 00:01:15.873
Scroll down and tap Save. The off day is saved and appears in the list for December. Attendance cannot be saved on that day.

00:01:23.766 --> 00:01:30.030
The calendar is up to date. Use the same steps for events and other off days.
